00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:09,400
the psalmist knows that as goes their king, so goes their physical representation of God's presence on earth.

189
00:35:09,400 --> 00:35:15,400
If Israel is not doing well, then God's presence on earth as it is in heaven is not doing well.

