00:35:21,400 --> 00:35:28,400
then their access to God's dwelling presence goes away. And this is the horrific story of the nation of Israel,

192
00:35:28,400 --> 00:35:36,400
is that they so rebelled against God that the presence of God leaves the tabernacle of God.

193
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:47,400
They're praying, "God, protect our king." Because as our king goes, so goes your presence.

194
00:35:47,400 --> 00:35:51,400
And as New Covenant people, I have some encouraging news for you this morning,

