00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:09,400
Because we have a new king, an eternal king, one that is seated on the throne beside God.

197
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:15,400
The ultimate anointed one and king has done for us what no earthly anointed king of Israel could ever do.

